{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "68289a176fa044e4c00b386eff2d4a42509dc5c7996671eb5424c543a222867f", "ja": "ロックフェスに出場する『D/Zeal』。\n大勢の出演者の中でどうすれば目立てるかと\n思案する静香だったが、自分たちの力を信じ\nていると言うジュリアに、いつも通りのパフ\nォーマンスを披露しようと決意した。", "zh": "参加摇滚音乐节的『D/Zeal』。\n静香思考着该如何在众多出演者中脱颖而出，\n但听到茱莉亚说相信自己的力量后，她决定拿出一如既往的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bf97a4252017d81d09ac33f900222216c8f1e632494a194b4974f275635f69e", "ja": "く～っ、この盛り上がり！\nやっぱロックフェスはいいな！", "zh": "呜～，这热烈的气氛！  \n果然摇滚音乐节就是棒啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9764f294c9fcb642bc732ee71ed7aa3e74de154fee79c673a6d9cf9fd54fd9a8", "ja": "本当に、すごい熱気ですね。こんなイベントに、\n私たちD/Zealを呼んでもらえるなんて……。", "zh": "真的好热烈啊。没想到竟然会邀请我们D/Zeal参加这样的活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d6868c73abf723949edfb3f101697ed1e4eccd4dd6171c9aea9b60f67edbf4e", "ja": "いろんなバンドやアーティストが出演するんですよね。\n私たちも、がんばらないと……！", "zh": "有很多乐队和艺人会登台演出吧。\n我们也得加油才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "5eec77ff3f816c1a1abd03ddf8ac25ac414ea3d126571484e85c7a73aabe9b06", "ja": "おっ？　シズ、なんか張りきってんじゃん。\n頼もしいな♪", "zh": "哦？静，干劲十足嘛。\n真可靠♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "d4da551e67967e8d95787e34d47c389b3b408be00dc9ea55254b1b886b6453c6", "ja": "それはそうですよ。私たちを知らないお客さんにも、\nちゃんと楽しんでもらいたいですから。", "zh": "那当然。因为我也想让不了解我们的观众好好享受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "7dc92386425b4f925fc47e6dd461dc812b6695e7f97bd8b7347dbeb13c9dfd4c", "ja": "ここはアウェイですけど、\nせめて、爪痕くらい残さなきゃ……。", "zh": "这里虽然是客场，\n但至少也得留下点痕迹才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "09e994a5e2d034207b0857f2c83da5d2a0ab1b133e1ed0323712431727aa8b7f", "ja": "アウェイ、ね。\nま、たしかにそうかもな。", "zh": "这是客场啊。\n嗯，确实可能是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "3bf45984441d1ba2a9e857823471dc4440156b2a6ee2421c9046f53ce12162f5", "ja": "ジュリアさんは、こういうフェスって\n初めてじゃないんですよね？", "zh": "茱莉亚先生，您不是第一次参加这种音乐节了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "951491529a1368969ad767cb9f9120e8ca1e56f16857a9e07c123af748248341", "ja": "初めてじゃないって言っても、客として\n参加するのと、ステージに立つのは全然違うしなぁ。", "zh": "虽说不是第一次，但作为观众参加和站上舞台完全是两码事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "2797bedf3f224eee3f511db853bb39aa362bd34f631b6f2b56049cdf42e47423", "ja": "たしかに……。あの、ロックフェスって、\nどんなことをすれば盛り上がるんでしょう！？", "zh": "确实……那个，摇滚音乐节要做些什么才能让气氛热烈起来呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "e5740d07e2ae551540c128d1fe2422fcac7ac722ac8cadf5aa95680f6060fe16", "ja": "そうだな、いろいろあるけど……\nやっぱ一番は、過激なライブパフォーマンスかな？", "zh": "这个嘛，方法有很多……但要说最重要的，果然还是激情四射的现场表演吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "7bb2fc41b891a69013dc86a7d78ce1892d8145cc7fc630582ac331378396761d", "ja": "客を煽ったり、客席にダイブしたり……。\nあとは、ギターを壊したり？", "zh": "煽动观众、跳向观众席……\n还有砸烂吉他之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "9a4eb6c06a317543f4658a1485a18c6de74bdf42e531fffbae261d9a0ac8e14f", "ja": "背中に回して弾いてみたり、歯で弾いてみたり……\n道具使って弾くってのもあったな。", "zh": "试试绕到背后弹，或者用牙齿弹……\n还有用工具来弹之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "3df541b7299ebe78c3a633536a434cd154bd547a1bf5b93ec8f0a08b71aa4a3b", "ja": "そ、それは、私たちには無理そうですね……。\nジュリアさんはともかく、私はギターが弾けませんし。", "zh": "那、那样对我们来说，似乎不太可能呢……。\n且不说茱莉亚先生，我又不会弹吉他。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "94b1a9501ed7dce1e49e657617d45bac68dd460b382559d1d06851f3618a4fa0", "ja": "まぁ、ロックフェスだからな。\n半端なコトをやっても、ブーイングされるだけだ。", "zh": "毕竟是摇滚音乐节嘛。\n要是做些半吊子的事，只会招来嘘声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "f2f8573ccb1ed94b048a926e59ef4bf8b07e11be7d674541176efe80b8ba9351", "ja": "ロックフェスに来る連中は、盛り上がりたくて\n来てるんだ。その期待に応えるのは、大変だぜ？", "zh": "来摇滚音乐节的人，都是想嗨起来才来的。要回应他们的期待，可不容易啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "44351a347bf8a1a9f618b35495d0e71ed103f48576e39cfcc94eb43aadaa8d52", "ja": "そうですね。……私たちはアイドルです。でも、\n自分たちのパフォーマンスに、自信を持っています。", "zh": "是啊。……我们是偶像。但是，我们对自己的表演有信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "83c40afa35b5a9690bb4c29580aaec7fbf3d9e8a457cc10bb9b8b0a33b6ea192", "ja": "アイドルだから中途半端だなんて、\nそんなこと、思われたくありません！", "zh": "我不希望别人因为我们是偶像，就觉得我们做事不够认真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "4bb1e8b665fa9508c1e686b385ab835e117b5d58231f5d994a6f0b66951576d3", "ja": "ははっ。……やっぱり、シズはロックだな！", "zh": "哈哈……果然，静香就是摇滚啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "e4e7e49bf4208b31ba2a12c4da44c5e261139c090072a485a31ba50f70c52a0c", "ja": "その負けん気があれば、大丈夫だって\nあたしは思うんだけどな。", "zh": "有这股不服输的劲头，我觉得就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b75335daf20b73ff6c8b2252f4296349a09b87739e6153dfe6832b67ce3a68a", "ja": "ジュリアさん……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "d12b76cae188545b3ef3dcb56bc6ede1a1bb96189a868fa63ba73d2459ec2317", "ja": "たしかにアイドルにとって、ロックフェスは\nアウェイかもしれない。けど、シズの言うとおりだ。", "zh": "对偶像来说，摇滚音乐节确实可能是客场。  \n不过，静香说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "f01953ac5382d5ee2e6f0de6996db4f4793cc875d125cdd639b03c4e55cbd9eb", "ja": "あたしは、D/Zealに自信を持ってる。だから\n劇場と同じように、ウチらの魂を届ければOKだ！", "zh": "我对D/Zeal有信心。所以只要像在剧场一样，把我们的灵魂传达出去就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "fa85aa79c757796d9a0d97425386a1c021bb66a224527e50892a892a4d404593", "ja": "ジュリアさん……はい！\nあの、がんばりましょうね！", "zh": "茱莉亚先生……好的！\n那个，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e9a6a7ffe69a64a1935ead0d574f88a42381f6d7339adcf958f14d5ad2c500d", "ja": "当然だ！　この調子で、\nステージでも、最高のシズを見せてくれよな♪", "zh": "那是当然！保持这个劲头，\n在舞台上也让我见识一下最棒的静香吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "d380ae4f6061fd5c7ee0a5314bc5307442f6590df111d67a3d118a9288ba4327", "ja": "もちろんです！　このフェスのお客さん全員、\n私たちのファンにするつもりで挑みます！", "zh": "那是当然的！我会抱着把这次音乐节的所有观众，\n都变成我们粉丝的决心去挑战的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b8b9f0a40b3e714e977b940d4a849f6799565e4d6893a12bf03080fae7884a3", "ja": "いいね！　ロックだぜ、シズ♪\nとなると、あたしも負けてらんないな……。", "zh": "不错嘛！真够摇滚的啊，静♪\n这样的话，我也不能输啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "30d85d1311d0ef28f61c2098d55eb179b1fbff0871f9727ac43fda45f06622e5", "ja": "やっぱり、歯でギターを弾くしかないか……？", "zh": "果然只能用牙齿弹吉他了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "ebcf5e4c7f91724eba721638b73b52b56519103d11bd08eb7b00c6090ea20412", "ja": "え……？　ま、待ってください！　ジュリアさん、\n本気ですか！？　アイドル的に、それはちょっと……！", "zh": "咦……？等、等一下！茱莉亚先生，您是认真的吗！？从偶像的角度来说，那有点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "43babb39e62533cf5acb71a679861730b3e756567672e573e94b9ab05884fe7e", "ja": "え、ダメか？　なら、ギターを壊す……のはないから、\n客席にダイブで……。", "zh": "诶，不行吗？那就砸坏吉他……这也不行，那就跳进观众席……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "2eab225a01f65c9e1fdfcc253416de17e77da5ca3c3de2496f190e68b29b5717", "ja": "もう、ジュリアさん！　いつもどおりにやるって\nさっき言ったばかりじゃないですか！", "zh": "真是的，茱莉亚！刚才不是才说过\n要和平常一样表现吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_007_dz_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_007_dz_01_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "970c69a75b9434ce20775a39620c1ed7fdd9fb05ee99ab5fb5332c6ff16071aa", "ja": "絶対にダメですからね！", "zh": "绝对不可以哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
